%
"Em" E2 E2 E2 | G3 F E2 | "B" ^D3 D E2 | F3 ^D B,2 |
w:Re-mem-ber, O thou man, O thou man, O thou man,
%
"Em" E2 E2 E2 | G3 F E2 | "B" ^D2 D2 E2 | F6 |
w:Re-mem-ber O thou man, thy time is spent.
%
"G" G2 B2 B2 | B3 A G2 | "D" F2 A2 A2 | A3 G F2 |
w:Re-mem-ber, O thou man, how thou cams't to me then,
%
